# Explicit vectorization (M-JELLY slice).  ⊞ zip = elementwise binary op over two
# lists.  ′atom is auto-wrapped, so builtin ops pass straight to higher-order words.
5⍳5⍳′+⊞⍕␤            # elementwise sum of two range(5)s -> 0 2 4 6 8
4⍳4⍳′*⊞∑Ṅ␤           # dot product  range(4)·range(4)   -> 14
10→k:f←k+;5⍳′f€⍕␤    # broadcast +10 over range(5)      -> 10 11 12 13 14
